      "uid": "zhcn:3ea2dea0e12f16538bb8c406",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛时为了让双方都能满足而竭尽全力。\n料理则为了让双方都能满足而大量供应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "467667d88d434edd38cb5912f29b781a6c7734045075e3769d144697f9668f87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
