      "uid": "zhcn:3adc7ecbf2e5565d18e7f894",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是菱曙理想中的模样，\n宛如力士们为了共同变得勇猛健壮\n所必需的存在──",
      "source_fingerprint": "592eec922b3ccf0a0b6f21c6bc646cb114bd46b25e08a64ed60f3b80744254f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
