      "uid": "zhcn:75ac7f86a2b749a536ebacd2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "Thank you，菱曙！\n大家一起热热闹闹的，超级开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4367fc3e8c92d67cd62507569e93cf8ca4229ba52793c859803c868f50c1ffaa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
