      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为总觉得\n现在我超级有精神的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30b06887e1d02d3b3a8392b125ddacae40d6b67ac4cdfd7764af3e4e9f08098d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e2ecdbd7ea66b76d0e67a75",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身心都很巨大的大树快车，\n以及压倒性的班长樱花进王。\n她们各自带着满足的神情来打招呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5299e28496ce6bd4684c0c060f700f4945196499be7987a46f9becde34b3c201",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1028/storytimeline_501028100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b683044b7760e6f008c38ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王是以短距离为主，\n大树快车则是以短距离、英里为主，\n两人皆是拥有亮眼成绩的强者。",
